    "detailed_description": "This is a survival escape action game from a huge wave that will make you feel fear and despair within the first minute.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe setting is an exoplanet where waves of over 3,000 feet (about 900 meters) are constantly hitting the surface of the planet, due to the gravity of a giant red dwarf star and its orbital period of about 60 minutes.<br />\r\nThe objective of the player is to escape from the waves and survive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is an escape game, but there are no complicated puzzle elements; all you need is the courage and strength to overcome fear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOvercoming this fear, thinking and acting in order to survive, continuing to challenge without giving up, and the scenery you see after surviving will surely leave a strong impression on the minds of those who play the game.",
    "about_the_game": "This is a survival escape action game from a huge wave that will make you feel fear and despair within the first minute.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe setting is an exoplanet where waves of over 3,000 feet (about 900 meters) are constantly hitting the surface of the planet, due to the gravity of a giant red dwarf star and its orbital period of about 60 minutes.<br />\r\nThe objective of the player is to escape from the waves and survive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is an escape game, but there are no complicated puzzle elements; all you need is the courage and strength to overcome fear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOvercoming this fear, thinking and acting in order to survive, continuing to challenge without giving up, and the scenery you see after surviving will surely leave a strong impression on the minds of those who play the game.",
    "short_description": "This is a survival escape action game from a huge wave where you can experience fear and despair within the first minute. The goal is to run around freely in 3D space from a first-person perspective and avoid large waves. The joy of conquering a huge wave is immeasurable.",
